    <briefdescription>
<para>Versioned link state (for ABA prevention). </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Combines state and version; version incremented on every state change. Prevents ABA problem: even if state cycles V1→V2→V1, version differs. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
